le-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Les micronutriments</button>:</strong>&nbsp;Vitamines et min&eacute;raux essentiels au bon fonctionnement du corps.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">L\'eau</button>:</strong>&nbsp;Indispensable pour l\'hydratation et le transport des nutriments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Adopter une alimentation &eacute;quilibr&eacute;e permet de maintenir un poids sain, pr&eacute;venir les maladies chroniques et am&eacute;liorer la qualit&eacute; de vie.</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\"><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\"><strong>Les Bases d\'une Alimentation &Eacute;quilibr&eacute;e</strong></button></h2>\r\n<ol class=\"marker:text-textOff list-decimal\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decor