 prot&eacute;ines de diverses sources telles que le lait, les &oelig;ufs, le soja, ou les pois. Elle est souvent utilis&eacute;e pour augmenter l\'apport en prot&eacute;ines dans l\'alimentation quotidienne, ce qui est particuli&egrave;rement utile pour les sportifs et ceux qui cherchent &agrave; d&eacute;velopper ou &agrave; maintenir leur masse musculaire.</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\"><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\"><strong>Types de Prot&eacute;ines en Poudre</strong></button></h2>\r\n<ol class=\"marker:text-textOff list-decimal\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Whey Protein</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Concentr&eacute;</button>:</strong>&nbsp;Contient environ 70-80 % de prot&eacute;ines, est moins cher et convient bien aux d&eacute;butants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Isolat</button>:</strong>&nbsp;Plus pur avec au moins 90 % de prot&eacute;ines, id&eacute;al pour ceux qui cherchent &agrave; minimiser les graisses et le lactose.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Hydrolys&eacute;</button>:</strong>&nbsp;Rapidement absorb&eacute;, souvent utilis&eacute; par les sportifs de haut niveau.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Prot&eacute;ine de Cas&eacute;ine</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Se dig&egrave;re lentement, ce qui prolonge la lib&eacute;ration des acides amin&eacute;s dans le sang, id&eacute;ale pour la nuit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Prot&eacute;ines V&eacute;g&eacute;tales</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Soja</button>:</strong>&nbsp;Tr&egrave;s riche en prot&eacute;ines et souvent utilis&eacute;e par les v&eacute;g&eacute;tariens.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Pois</button>:</strong>&nbsp;Aide &agrave; la sati&eacute;t&eacute; et convient bien pour la gestion du poids.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Riz Brun</button>:</strong>&nbsp;Riche en fer et convient aux v&eacute;g&eacute;taliens.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Chanvre</button>:</strong>&nbsp;Contient tous les acides amin&eacute;s essentiels et est riche en om&eacute;ga-3 et om&eacute;ga-6.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\"><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\"><strong>Bienfaits de la Prot&eacute;ine en Poudre</strong></button></h2>\r\n<ol class=\"marker:text-textOff list-decimal\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">D&eacute;veloppement Musculaire</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Aide &agrave; construire et &agrave; r&eacute;parer les muscles apr&egrave;s l\'exercice.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Perte de Poids</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Augmente la sati&eacute;t&eacute; et soutient la gestion du poids.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">R&eacute;cup&eacute;ration</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Acc&eacute;l&egrave;re la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration musculaire apr&egrave;s l\'effort physique.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\"><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\"><strong>Comment Choisir la Meilleure Prot&eacute;ine en Poudre ?</strong></button></h2>\r\n<ol class=\"marker:text-textOff list-decimal\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Objectifs Personnels</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Si vous cherchez &agrave; d&eacute;velopper votre masse musculaire, le lactos&eacute;rum est id&eacute;al.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Pour la perte de poids, les prot&eacute;ines v&eacute;g&eacute;tales comme le pois peuvent &ecirc;tre pr&eacute;f&eacute;rables.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Tol&eacute;rance Alimentaire</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Si vous &ecirc;tes intol&eacute;rant au lactose, optez pour des alternatives v&eacute;g&eacute;tales.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Qualit&eacute; du Produit</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Choisissez des marques r&eacute;put&eacute;es pour leur qualit&eacute; et leur puret&eacute;.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\"><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\"><strong>Conseils Pratiques pour Utiliser la Prot&eacute;ine en Poudre</strong></button></h2>\r\n<ol class=\"marker:text-textOff list-decimal\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Dosage</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Utilisez une cuill&egrave;re standard pour mesurer la quantit&eacute; recommand&eacute;e.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Hydratation</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Buvez suffisamment d\'eau pour faciliter la digestion et l\'absorption.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Calendrier Coh&eacute;rent</button>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Prenez-la r&eacute;guli&egrave;rement pour maintenir un apport constant en prot&eacute;ines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\"><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\"><strong>FAQ sur la Prot&eacute;ine en Poudre</strong></button></h2>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">1. Quel type de prot&eacute;ine en poudre est le plus efficace pour la musculation ?</button></strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Le lactos&eacute;rum est g&eacute;n&eacute;ralement recommand&eacute; pour sa rapidit&eacute; d\'absorption et sa teneur &eacute;lev&eacute;e en acides amin&eacute;s essentiels.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">2. Puis-je prendre de la prot&eacute;ine en poudre sans faire de sport ?</button></strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Oui, elle peut aider &agrave; augmenter votre apport en prot&eacute;ines quotidiennes, ce qui est b&eacute;n&eacute;fique pour la sant&eacute; g&eacute;n&eacute;rale.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark/30 dark:hover:text-superDark dark:hover:decoration-superDark/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">3. Quelle est la meilleure prot&eacute;ine en poudre pour les v&eacute;g&eacute;tariens ?</button></strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"my-0\">Les prot&eacute;ines de pois ou de soja sont des options populaires et efficaces.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg font-[500] first:mt-3\"><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[