\": 12       }',NULL,'<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\"><strong>1) Combien de prot&eacute;ines par portion ?</strong><br>Cette formule apporte&nbsp;<strong>25 g de prot&eacute;ines par portion</strong>.<span aria-label=\"Anabolic Whey 80 - ProActive | 2.25Kg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span><span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\"><strong>2) Combien de cr&eacute;atine par portion ?</strong><br>Elle apporte&nbsp;<strong>5 g de cr&eacute;atine monohydrate par portion</strong>.<span data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\"><strong>3) C&rsquo;est quoi &ldquo;Multi‑Protein&rdquo; ?</strong><br>C&rsquo;est un m&eacute;lange de plusieurs sources de prot&eacute;ines (whey/lait/soja/bl&eacute; hydrolys&eacute; selon les fiches revendeurs) pour un profil d&rsquo;acides amin&eacute;s plus complet.<span data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\"><strong>4) &Agrave; quoi sert la Vitamin Matrix ?</strong><br>Elle ajoute un support en vitamines/min&eacute;raux pour accompagner l&rsquo;&eacute;nergie, la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration et la forme g&eacute;n&eacute;rale pendant les p&eacute;riodes d&rsquo;entra&icirc;nement r&eacute;gulier.<span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span><span data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\"><strong>5) Quand prendre Anabolic Whey 80 With Creatine ?</strong><br>Le plus pratique est apr&egrave;s l&rsquo;entra&icirc;nement, et une autre option est la collation (matin ou apr&egrave;s‑midi) si l&rsquo;apport prot&eacute;ique de la journ&eacute;e est trop bas.<span aria-label=\"Anabolic Whey 80 - ProActive | 2.25Kg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\"><strong>6) Est-ce plut&ocirc;t pour prise de masse ou s&egrave;che ?</strong><br>Elle peut servir aux deux : le produit aide surtout &agrave; monter les prot&eacute;ines et la performance, et c&rsquo;est le total calorique de la journ&eacute;e qui d&eacute;termine prise de masse ou s&egrave;che.<span aria-label=\"Anabolic Whey 80 - ProActive | 2.25Kg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\"><strong>7) Combien de servings dans le pot ?</strong><br>Le packaging annonce&nbsp;<strong>64 servings</strong>.<span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>','Description','Avis client','Valeurs nutritionnelles','Questions'),(73,7,'NITRO TECH WHEY GOLD – 2,3KG','produits/September2023/7FnGios9QjMhPhDZWF9F.webp',98,NULL,300,NULL,259,'<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_bounceIn bounceIn wpb_start_animation animated\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"912\"><strong data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"910\">🏆 NITRO TECH WHEY GOLD &ndash; 2,3KG | Prot&eacute;ine Ultra-Pure pour une Musculation Optimale !</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1136\">🔹 <strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"927\">Marque</strong> : <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"944\">MuscleTech</strong><br data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"947\">🔹 <strong data-star