reuses personnes.<span data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\">Peut-on m&eacute;langer 100% Whey Gold Standard avec du lait ?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\">Oui, elle peut &ecirc;tre m&eacute;lang&eacute;e avec de l&rsquo;eau ou du lait, ce dernier augmentant la texture, le go&ucirc;t et l&rsquo;apport calorique de votre shaker.<span data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\">100% Whey Gold Standard convient-elle aux d&eacute;butants ?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\">Cette whey convient aussi bien aux d&eacute;butants qu&rsquo;aux avanc&eacute;s, &agrave; condition d&rsquo;&ecirc;tre utilis&eacute;e en compl&eacute;ment d&rsquo;une alimentation adapt&eacute;e et d&rsquo;un entra&icirc;nement r&eacute;gulier.<span data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>','Description','Avis client','Valeurs nutritionnelles','Questions'),(145,7,'PROSTAR 100% WHEY PROTEIN – 2.4KG','produits/September2023/0vazw9mSOiwl2pyBgPWz.webp',855,NULL,260,NULL,239,'<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_fadeInUp fadeInUp wpb_start_animation animated\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div id=\"aplus_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\".7\" data-csa-c-component=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-cs-type=\"DETAIL_PAGE_AMABOT\" data-csa-c-id=\"ua6ycw-lih1qm-2wgckq-aqejlm\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus_feature_div\">\r\n<div id=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-large bucket\">\r\n<div class=\"aplus-v2 desktop celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"5zuxh