quo;, plus long et plus productif, surtout quand l&rsquo;intensit&eacute; augmente.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Les b&eacute;n&eacute;fices pour votre entra&icirc;nement</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-quiet list-disc\">\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>&Eacute;nergie</strong>&nbsp;: aide &agrave; d&eacute;marrer fort et &agrave; garder un bon rythme.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Focus</strong>&nbsp;: utile pour rester concentr&eacute; sur la s&eacute;ance. <strong>Endurance</strong>&nbsp;: aide &agrave; prolonger l&rsquo;effort et retarder la fatigue.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Pump / congestion</strong>&nbsp;: soutien de la circulation et de meilleures sensations &agrave; l&rsquo;entra&icirc;nement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Comment l&rsquo;utiliser ?<br></strong><br>&Agrave; prendre g&eacute;n&eacute;ralement&nbsp;<strong>avant l&rsquo;entra&icirc;nement</strong>, en respectant la portion indiqu&eacute;e sur l&rsquo;&eacute;tiquette et en ajustant selon votre tol&eacute;rance &agrave; la&nbsp;<strong>caf&eacute;ine</strong>. &Eacute;vitez de le consommer trop tard le soir si vous &ecirc;tes sensible, et gardez une bonne&nbsp;<strong>hydratation</strong> pendant la s&eacute;ance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Pour qui ?</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"marker:text-quiet list-disc\">\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\">Les pratiquants de&nbsp;<strong>musculation</strong>&nbsp;qui veulent plus d&rsquo;<strong>&eacute;nergie</strong>&nbsp;et de&nbsp;<strong>pump</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\">Les sportifs HIIT / cross‑training cherchant une meilleure&nbsp;<strong>endurance</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\">Ceux qui veulent un pr&eacute;‑workout &ldquo;complet&rdquo; pour&nbsp;<strong>performance + focus</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>',1,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-07 13:03:29','2026-01-10 14:29:14','842595134445','c4-pre-workout-280-g-cellucor','0',11,'0','0','[]',5,'<p>C4 Pre‑Workout Cellucor : pr&eacute;‑workout pour booster l&rsquo;<strong>&eacute;nergie</strong>, le&nbsp;<strong>focus</strong>, l&rsquo;<strong>endurance</strong>&nbsp;et la&nbsp;<strong>performance</strong>. Disponible en Tunisie sur Protein.tn.</p>',NULL,1,'C4 Pre Workout 280 g Cellucor Tunisie préworkout énergie focus endurance performance pump Protein.tn.','C4 PRE WORKOUT 280 G - CELLUCOR : pré‑workout pour booster l’énergie, le focus et l’endu