 &amp; 4 Station JX-Fit\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Programme club complet</strong>&nbsp;: 8 utilisateurs rotation &mdash; 45min circuits full body, progression ind&eacute;pendante piles s&eacute;lectionnables. &Eacute;conomise 80% espace vs. 8 machines s&eacute;par&eacute;es, parfait studios personnels/PT cabinets. Design modulaire &eacute;volutif (ajouts stations possibles).<span class=\"inline-flex\" aria-label=\"Vente de 8 Station Multi Gym jx fitness Tunisie\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\">Robuste et pro, ce multi gym JX motive assiduit&eacute; : garantie 10 ans cadre/poids, peinture anti-rouille, c&acirc;bles 2000lbs traction. Utilisateurs adorent &ldquo;salle compl&egrave;te un appareil&rdquo;. Commandez Protein.tn, livraison rapide Tunisie, entra&icirc;nement illimit&eacute;.<span class=\"inline-flex\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:51\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>',1,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-23 13:20:25','2025-12-26 08:46:51',NULL,'8-station-multi-gym','0',52,'0','0','[]',5,'<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:114\">8 Station Multi Gym JX Fitness : 8 postes full body simultan&eacute; (pecs/dos/jambes/bras), piles 100kgx8, acier pro 35000 TND home gym commercial. Tunisie.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,1,'8 Station Multi Gym JX Fitness — 8 postes full body simultané piles 100kg home gym commercial Protein.tn Tunisie.','8 Station Multi Gym : 8 utilisateurs full body pecs dos jambes, piles dédiées 100kg, acier pro  gym Tunisie.','<meta name=\"title\" content=\"8 Station Multi Gym JX Fitness | 8 Utilisateurs Full Body – Protein.tn\">\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"8 Station Multi Gym JX Fitness : 8 postes simultanés pecs/dos/jambes/bras, piles 100kgx8, acier pro home gym commercial. 35000 TND Tunisie.\">\r\n<meta na