\r\n    \"sodiumContent\": \"0.17 g\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n</script>',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<ol class=\"marker:text-quiet list-decimal\">\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>C&rsquo;est quoi WHEY PRO WARRIORS 2KG ?</strong><br>C&rsquo;est une whey prot&eacute;ine concentr&eacute;e (WPC) destin&eacute;e &agrave; compl&eacute;ter l&rsquo;apport en prot&eacute;ines au quotidien.<span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Combien de prot&eacute;ines par dose ?</strong><br>21 g de prot&eacute;ines par portion de 30 g.<span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Combien de calories par portion ?</strong><br>115.69 kcal par portion de 30 g.<span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Quelle est la dose recommand&eacute;e ?</strong><br>Dose quotidienne recommand&eacute;e : 30 g.<span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Comment la prendre (m&eacute;lange) ?</strong><br>M&eacute;langer 30 g avec 300 ml d&rsquo;eau, de pr&eacute;f&eacute;rence apr&egrave;s l&rsquo;entra&icirc;nement.<span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Combien de servings dans le pot 2 kg ?</strong><br>Environ 66 servings indiqu&eacute;s sur l&rsquo;&eacute;tiquette.<span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\">\r\n<p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\"><strong>Allerg&egrave;nes : est-ce qu&rsquo;elle contient lait/soja ?</strong><br>Oui (lait et soja), et elle peut contenir des traces de gluten.<span aria-label=\"image.jpg\" data-state=\"closed\">​</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(454,27,'TEST HD ÉLITE 120 CAPS','produits/April2025/60vAY5f9F9LHZCzqebnK.webp',93,NULL,180,NULL,149,'<h2 class=\"\" data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"592\">💪 TEST HD &Eacute;LITE 120 CAPS &ndash; Booster Naturel de Testost&eacute;rone par Muscletech</h2>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"890\"><strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"611\">TEST HD &Eacute;LITE</strong> de <strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"629\">Muscletech</strong> est un <strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"679\">booster de testost&eacute;rone ultra-puissant</strong>, con&ccedil;u pour les hommes souhaitant <strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"767\">augmenter naturellement leur taux de testost&eacute;rone</strong>, am&eacute;liorer leur <strong data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"802\">force physique</strong>, stimuler leur <s