nabolisme imm&eacute;diat</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1286\">🥛 <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1286\">Tr&egrave;s faible teneur en lactose &ndash; digestion facile</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1337\">🔬 <strong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1337\">Riche en BCAA et acides amin&eacute;s essentiels</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1383\">🍫 <strong data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1383\">Go&ucirc;t onctueux et sans sucres ajout&eacute;s</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1439\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1439\">🌍 <strong data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1439\">Convient &agrave; tous les r&eacute;gimes sportifs intensifs</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1482\">🧪&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1480\">Utilisation recommand&eacute;e</strong> :</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1614\">Prendre 1 dose (30 g) avec 200-300 ml d&rsquo;eau apr&egrave;s l&rsquo;entra&icirc;nement ou entre les repas pour un apport en prot&eacute;ines rapide et efficace.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1640\">📦&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1638\">Format</strong> :</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1684\">Pot de <strong data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1657\">2KG</strong>, soit <strong data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1684\">environ 66 doses</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1769\">Saveurs disponibles : Vanille, Chocolat, Cookies &amp; Cream <em data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1769\">(&agrave; adapter selon stock)</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1810\">🔒&nbsp;<strong